{"parentUuid":"9a86bd87-039c-4b07-9928-093a0f9cca4b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfiW2b4oGXCKsUTtb4PXi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about a phone not connecting to wifi at school and asking for a password. Let me check the context:\n\n1. This is a PUPIL (elev)\n2. They have a PHONE (mobil) that won't connect to wifi at school\n3. The phone is asking for a wifi password\n\nAccording to my instructions, on a phone/iPad/Android/Mac, there is no Zork Helper button. They need to:\n1. Connect to FRID-iot with password friddeploy first\n2. Then go to onboard.frid-iks.no and click \"Last ned\"\n3. Don't open login before they are on FRID-iot\n4. Don't ask which networks they see\n\nThe phone is probably seeing a wifi network and asking for a password. The issue is that they need to connect to FRID-iot first with the bootstrap password, then download the certificate.\n\nI should NOT ask them to \"list the networks they see\" or any diagnostic questions. I should just give them the next step.\n\nThe instructions say: \"Do not interview them. Give the next action they can take. A question is not an action. Never ask them to open the network list, name the networks they see, or say which device they have — that is diagnosing, and it loses them.\"\n\nSo I should just tell them:\n\n1. First: koble til FRID-iot med passordet friddeploy\n2. Then: gå til onboard.frid-iks.no og trykk Last ned\n\nAnd I need to \"Answer first, reasoning after. Never open with a preamble.\"\n\nAlso: \"Answer shape: What's wrong, in one plain sentence - What to do now — one step, concrete - What to do if that doesn't work, or who to contact\"\n\nLet me be concise. They're asking for a password. The problem is they haven't connected to the bootstrap network yet. \n\nOne instruction: Koble deg til wifi-nettverket FRID-iot med passordet friddeploy først.\nThe device type matters here — this is a mobile, not a Windows PC, so Zork Helper doesn't apply.\n\nThe answer should follow: what's wrong (phone tries to connect directly, needs bootstrap network first), what to do (connect to FRID-iot with friddeploy), structured per STUDENT.md's phone/Mac/iPad/Android guide in Norwegian bokmål.\n\nGiven the instruction to answer short and avoid interviewing, I'll skip clarifying questions and just give the next concrete action: koble til wifi-nettverket FRID-iot med passordet friddeploy, deretter gå til https://onboard.frid-iks.no/, trykk Last ned, og logg inn med skolekontoen.\n\nJeg bør inkludere bildet av tilkoblingsdialogen siden det kan hjelpe:\n\n![Koble til FRID-iot – skriv passordet og klikk Neste](asset:wifi-frid-iot-passord-20260910.png)\n\nKjernen i problemet er at de prøver å koble til hovednettverket direkte uten sertifikatet - løsningen er å koble til bootstrap-nettverket først.\n\nStrukturen blir: koble til **FRID-iot** med passordet **friddeploy**, vis bildet som støtte, deretter gå til onboard.frid-iks.no for å laste ned sertifikatet med skolekontoen. Siden brukeren ba om kort svar, holder jeg meg til de essensielle stegene uten unødig utfyllingstekst.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12850,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1945,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1815},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12850,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"requestId":"req_011CfiW2apfL5NVMqGZAUAAJ","type":"assistant","uuid":"8825169d-4e98-4593-b2ce-b716b203afb2","timestamp":"2026-10-05T05:00:46.029Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jorgenthin_f\\.helix\\workspace","sessionI